#. module: escodoo_crm_custom
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:escodoo_crm_custom.field_crm_lead__escodoo_has_dedicated_team
msgid ""
"Indicates whether the customer has an internal team dedicated to supporting the ERP project. Typically includes a key user, manager, or technical contact responsible for coordination and validation.\n"
"\n"
"Guidelines:\n"
"- Enable if staff are committed to following the project, testing features, and facilitating decision-making.\n"
"- Disable if the customer depends entirely on external support or has no internal resources allocated."
msgstr ""

