msgid ""
"Key operational or strategic problems the customer expects to address with Odoo.\n"
"\n"
"Guidelines:\n"
"- Focus on the top 1–3 pains driving scope and urgency (e.g., lack of integration, manual processes, low visibility, compliance issues).\n"
"- Prefer the customer's own words to preserve context and nuance.\n"
"- Clarify impact (cost, risk, SLAs) and urgency to support prioritization."
msgstr ""

